<https://tplegacy.net/way-of-life/> <http://schema.org/description> "Each of you, as an individual, was born and raised in the love of your parents. You go through kindergarten, primary school, high school, and the university, and eventually, your view of life is broadened to a larger scope.\n\nYou want to see what society is like and what the people around you are doi"@en .
