<https://tplegacy.net/our-situation/> <http://schema.org/description> "This morning, my subject is \"Our Situation.\" Where do we stand? We know there is a God. We know that God created all things. Furthermore, we know that out of all His creations, human beings are His masterpiece. God, having created everything, is the center point of the whole universe; man is the cor"@en .
