<https://tplegacy.net/the-restoration-of-heart/> <http://schema.org/description> "\"Shim jung\" means heart in Korean or Japanese, but it is very difficult to translate. It means a little more than heart. It means heart, sentiment, and deep love all together.\n\nIn the course of restoration, we go the reverse way because man fell in the beginning. Then, what is the standard of our re"@en .
