<https://tplegacy.net/path-of-advancement-for-our-faith/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good evening. This evening, my subject will be \"The Path of Advancement for Our Faith.\" Not only Christians but all people who have faith in any sort of religion go the path of faith.\n\nCan you hear me in the rear seats? \n\nSome say no. If there be a God at all, and fallen men would want to reach Him,"@en .
