<https://tplegacy.net/the-last-frontline/> <http://schema.org/description> "This morning, my subject is \"The Last Frontline.\" Can you hear me in the rear seats? Looking at everything going on in this world, we can safely say that this is the close of the age, the latter days.\n\nEverything sown in the beginning will be reaped or harvested in the fall. Human history began with"@en .
