<https://tplegacy.net/before-our-father/> <http://schema.org/description> "You are now here. With this place as the center, you have four directions: east, west, south, and north. You are from the Netherlands, France, England, and America. Your ages are varied. You are male and female mingled together. We are studying what God's will is and trying to carry it out and to re"@en .
