<https://tplegacy.net/the-path-of-abel/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good morning. My subject this morning is \"The Path of Abel.\" We have been taught that Abel is the central figure in the providence of God. Abel is in the place of Adam, but Abel cannot tread on his road or path without the cooperation of others. And he must be equipped with certain conditions. The f"@en .
