<https://tplegacy.net/the-unification-philosophy-of-personality/> <http://schema.org/description> "In philosophy, one topic that is always explored concerns the nature of the ideal and material worlds. One always poses questions concerning the perfect first; only then does one pose questions concerning the material.\n\nHowever, the material and the ideal are true only in relationship to each other."@en .
