<https://tplegacy.net/our-advancement-and-retreat/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good morning! I think you have heard that I arrived in Washington a few days ago; this is my second visit since then, so you must have wanted to meet me.\n\nYou may have heard that I have been meeting some people over here, and I found no time for you, except for this morning. All my life has been a b"@en .
