<https://tplegacy.net/heart/> <http://schema.org/description> "You need to know about the heart to love each other.\n\nTherefore, I am going to talk to you about the heart. Heart is a very difficult word to translate from Korean into English. It is of more profound meaning than heart—a loving heart, a sensitive heart, a caring heart.\n\nThe heart is the source of l"@en .
