<https://tplegacy.net/victory-or-defeat/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good evening! We just had a telephone call from Korea; that is why we were delayed. Welcome home to Belvedere. I thank God that you are safely back. I can imagine that you have such long stories to tell each other, to tell me; I will be hearing from the state representatives, itinerary workers, and "@en .
