<https://tplegacy.net/message-to-the-american-people/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good morning. This is the first day of a new month. Entering a new month, I think of having passed one-third of the year. I have set the second seven-year course—the last three years of the second seven-year course were 1972, 1973, and 1974—and this is the second of the three.\n\nIn Japan, he promised"@en .
