<https://tplegacy.net/relationship-between-men-and-women/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good morning! Sit down!\n\nYou must be especially careful of the relationship between men and women. I say this lest you should cause a scandal. If you leave any rumor or scandal between men and women, you will never be blessed together.\n\nThe people of the U.S., especially, must change the concept of "@en .
