<https://tplegacy.net/our-present-mission/> <http://schema.org/description> "The world in which we live and we ourselves are results of something else, so we cannot solve our problems on our own. We say we have responsibilities, but they don't actually begin with us; we inherit them from our predecessors.\n\nEven though a certain past begins with me, it will not end with my de"@en .
