<https://tplegacy.net/those-who-are-left/> <http://schema.org/description> "My topic this morning is \"those who are left.\"\n\nWhat we are doing here will be long remembered in the history of our church and of the world, and we will be left in the memory of the people. We must be remembered by the people and by history. Our goal is to be remembered by the people and remain in "@en .
