<https://tplegacy.net/america-in-gods-providence/> <http://schema.org/description> "The history of humankind has had no clear goal or motive. From the viewpoint of today's situation, there is a serious question: Do we live in the form of the ideal world, or will the ideal world emerge from an extension of the present world?\n\nMore and more people long for one ideal world with freedo"@en .
