<https://tplegacy.net/the-completion-of-our-responsibility/> <http://schema.org/description> "I saw you a few minutes ago yesterday evening, and I'm glad to see you again tonight. Yesterday, when I saw you, I felt deep compassion, but tonight I feel at ease. It is a regulation that you must undergo a fast of at least 7 days to become a regular member.\n\nIf you have not gone through such a fas"@en .
