<https://tplegacy.net/the-world-age-and-our-mission/> <http://schema.org/description> "As you well know, the world in which we are living is not a world of peace or unity.\n\nThis world is the result not of God's will but of human will. Due to the human fall, we know that we are not living up to the standard set by God. Adam and Eve, who were created as children of God who deviated and "@en .
