<https://tplegacy.net/am-i-really-needed/> <http://schema.org/description> "Everyone living on the earth thinks of themselves first. Especially when one is born in an underprivileged country, thinking of himself as ugly, undereducated, without power, position, knowledge, or wealth, he is apt to think of himself first.\n\nYoung people as a whole, however, are in agony because "@en .
