<https://tplegacy.net/the-present-and-the-future/> <http://schema.org/description> "My topic this morning is \"The Present and the Future.\"\n\nSeen from the viewpoint of God, we are situated at a most critical point. You have heard many times about our second seven-year course. By the end of this year, it will be over, and we will be starting our mission in the third seven-year course"@en .
