<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-set-the-tradition/> <http://schema.org/description> "Good morning. \"Let Us Set the Tradition\" is my topic this morning.\n\nWe have members from many nations here. Americans have their own tradition. The Germans have their own tradition. The French have their own tradition.\n\nFrom God's viewpoint, the traditions they have so far set up are the traditions "@en .
