<https://tplegacy.net/the-true-pattern-of-family-life/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBarrytown, New York\n\nWhenever I'm here, you are disturbed because you cannot study very well. Today, I meant to just peep into the room and leave. Since I'm here, I feel I have to speak.\n\nToday, my topic will be \"The True Pattern of Family Life.\"\n\nAs I see things, Americans and Europeans don't miss"@en .
