<https://tplegacy.net/cain-abel-relationships/> <http://schema.org/description> "Today I'm going to tell you about the relationship between Cain and Abel, which is most important in the Unification movement.\n\nIf you have the wrong idea of the relationship between Cain and Abel, it is apt to lead you nowhere or to the place opposite to where you should be. As you know, Cain is on"@en .
