<https://tplegacy.net/who-will-be-responsible-for-the-providence-of-god/> <http://schema.org/description> "I'm going to talk on the subject, \"Who will be responsible for the providence of God and the world?\"\n\nCan America take the responsibility?\n\nI do not mean you, but America as a nation, can she take the responsibility?\n\nThe American government cannot take responsibility for the whole world, nor can th"@en .
