<https://tplegacy.net/a-needed-man/> <http://schema.org/description> "My topic this afternoon is \"A Needed Man.\" Here we have men and women seated separately. For men, women are necessary; for women, men are required. But in a world where men and women live together, the question we must ask is, who is needed most?\n\nIn your family, too, there's someone who is the most"@en .
