<https://tplegacy.net/human-death/> <http://schema.org/description> "Today I'm going to talk about human death. Eventually, you are going to die. Nobody wants to talk about death, but because we know that there is a spirit world where we live for eternity, we are serious or concerned about our death.\n\nIn my school days, I talked of death many times with Communists, a"@en .
