<https://tplegacy.net/iowc-members-and-a-victory-for-god-in-korea/> <http://schema.org/description> "After Vietnam, Korea will be the next target of Communist aggression, Koreans think. When you look at the Asian landmass, you can see that the Korean position is so feeble.\n\nThe Communists might even feel that they don't have to do anything; they can just blow this country away into the sea. The who"@en .
