<https://tplegacy.net/why-father-goes-to-sea/> <http://schema.org/description> "As you can see, I'm all suntanned. Those who are seeing me for the first time, please hold up your hands.\n\nNewcomers shouldn't think that I am this dark. I have been out at sea for quite a few days, and you must be wondering why I go to the sea so often. I want to tell you the reason.\n\nFrom now on, "@en .
