<https://tplegacy.net/yankee-stadium/> <http://schema.org/description> "As you know, today is September 1, 1975. Up to the present, you have been praying hard for our Yankee Stadium campaign next spring. With such a great goal ahead, we have to organize ourselves and systematize our activities towards that goal.\n\nWhether we can bring success to the campaign depends on h"@en .
