<https://tplegacy.net/unification-theological-seminary-inaugural-convocation-speech/> <http://schema.org/dateModified> "2025-10-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://tplegacy.net/unification-theological-seminary-inaugural-convocation-speech/> <http://schema.org/description> "In history, there have been philosophies and religious doctrines working in the background of politics, economics, the arts, and religion.\n\nNevertheless, the reality is that they are all stalemated, resulting confused and chaos, without having brought about the realization of their promised ideal wo"@en .
