<https://tplegacy.net/god-depends-on-us-alone/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nAll of you know this is a historical day; many of you actually participated in our experience of one year ago today. To restore this world and humankind, we must center on God's will.\n\nGod cannot accomplish His will by Himself alone but must work with man. If man had not fallen"@en .
