<https://tplegacy.net/our-pride/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nIt is human nature that everyone has the desire to be proud of something about themselves and their families. This desire has no boundary and is the same in the East and the West, in the past and the present, and affects everyday lives as well as famous people.\n\nAfter thinking "@en .
