<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-think-once-more/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nIn this world, we frequently see very unhappy people, particularly in places like prison. During my imprisonment in North Korea, I knew one prisoner who had been sentenced to death and worried about his day of execution all the time.\n\nGenerally, the most hopeful moment for any "@en .
