<https://tplegacy.net/all-things-depend-on-us/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nFirstly, I would like to wish you a happy New Year. This is the second Sunday of the new year. In sending 1977 away, everyone feels regret and sadness because of some lack of fulfillment. Not too many can look back on the entire year and say that they have done well, and partic"@en .
