<https://tplegacy.net/new-morning-of-glory/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nWhen we speak of glory, let us think for a moment: can glory come by itself, or does it imply two or more parts? Each one of us wants to have a day of glory. The literal translation of the title of this message means \"prosperity,\" and \"light or beam,\" or the light of prosperity"@en .
