<https://tplegacy.net/the-course-of-life-and-restoration-by-indemnification/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nEach day of life accumulates to make up a lifetime. Through the days of our lives, we progress from childhood to young adulthood to old age, and at the same time, a pattern of happiness or sadness is created.\n\nIn the course of life, there is love and laughter, sorrow and traged"@en .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-course-of-life-and-restoration-by-indemnification/> <http://schema.org/publisher> <https://tplegacy.net/#organization> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-course-of-life-and-restoration-by-indemnification/> <http://schema.org/inLanguage> "en" .
