<https://tplegacy.net/sorrow-and-tears/> <http://schema.org/dateModified> "2025-11-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://tplegacy.net/sorrow-and-tears/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nNo one really likes sorrow, and no one really likes tears, but no man, nor all of history, can avoid these two elements. We can ask whether God wanted to see a day of sorrow or a day of happiness when He created heaven and earth, and the answer obviously is that God wanted to s"@en .
<https://tplegacy.net/sorrow-and-tears/> <http://schema.org/publisher> <https://tplegacy.net/#organization> .
<https://tplegacy.net/sorrow-and-tears/> <http://schema.org/inLanguage> "en" .
