<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/dateModified> "2025-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nManhattan Center\n\nI would like to thank all of you for coming and celebrating this True Parents' birthday. All of us assembled in this auditorium have various, different backgrounds.\n\nWe have had different ways of life in the past and come from various cultural backgrounds, and furthermore, in your"@en .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/publisher> <https://tplegacy.net/#organization> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/inLanguage> "en" .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/timeRequired> "PT31M"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/author> <https://tplegacy.net/author/sun-myung-moon/> .
<https://tplegacy.net/the-will-of-god-and-thanksgiving/> <http://schema.org/about> <https://tplegacy.net/tag/sermons-about-gods-will/> .
