<https://tplegacy.net/my-life/> <http://schema.org/about> <https://tplegacy.net/tag/sermon/> .
<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Article> .
<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://schema.org/headline> "Where God Resides and His Course"@en .
<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://schema.org/url> "https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/" .
<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://schema.org/sameAs> <https://n2t.net/ark:/68749/where-god-resides-and-his-course> .
<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://schema.org/datePublished> "1978-03-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
