<https://tplegacy.net/where-god-resides-and-his-course/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nAll men want to be happy, and every day they live in pursuit of joy; nevertheless, one can never be happy alone. Happiness comes from a reciprocal relationship rather than from living all by oneself. No one can ever feel good if he is alone all the time.\n\nWe all know that God i"@en .
