<https://tplegacy.net/the-age-of-new-dispensation/> <http://schema.org/description> "London, England\n\nTime goes by very fast, and it has been four years since I was here last. I am sorry I couldn't come earlier. Centering on Mr. Orme, I understand you have worked very hard, while I have been working hard in America, fighting against Satan's arrows. In that respect, we have something"@en .
