<https://tplegacy.net/how-we-are-born-again/> <http://schema.org/description> "Lancaster Gate Church\nLondon, England\n\nA few days after his arrival, Rev. Moon began to make preparations for a Blessing (Wedding) Ceremony for over a hundred members of the Unification Church in Europe.\n\nShortly before midnight, he gathered the candidates for marriage to offer the following instruc"@en .
