<https://tplegacy.net/to-the-crusade/> <http://schema.org/description> "Lancaster Gate Church\nLondon, England\n\nRight after the 118 couple Blessing, Rev. Moon began to assemble a new International One World Crusade, an evangelical team made up of church members from all over Europe and the world.\n\nIn addition to the 236 newly blessed members, others began to arrive. A we"@en .
