<https://tplegacy.net/speech-to-the-one-world-crusade-europe/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLancaster Gate, London\n\nFor the last few days, you have been working in London. What do you feel about it? This is the first time in history that we have had such an activity as this in Europe, with so many countries centered on one town.\n\nSo, as this is the first time that anybody has done such wo"@en .
