<https://tplegacy.net/the-burden-on-our-shoulders/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLondon, England\n\nWe all have difficulties at some time or another in our lives. Especially when we want to excel or do better than other people, we have to work harder and experience more difficulties, and this is true of the family and nation as well as the individual.\n\nIf one nation wants to be m"@en .
