<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-be-grateful/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLondon, England\n\nNo one planned to be born. We just find that we have been born. And although your parents gave birth to you, they couldn't plan what kind of personality their baby would have.\n\nNow science has progressed, and parents can find out the sex of the baby before it is born, but previousl"@en .
