<https://tplegacy.net/victorious-sons-and-daughters/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLancaster Gate\nLondon, England\n\nJesus said that those who are willing to die will live, but those who try to live will die. How is that? If you are going to die, how can you live? Jesus' meaning is that to bear the cross of the heart, you have to go through this step of being willing to die. Bearin"@en .
