<https://tplegacy.net/the-go-world-brass-band/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nCleeve House, Wiltshire, England\n\nRev. Moon went out one day and bought sixty-one brand-new instruments to create the core of four new brass bands. Why? The Unification Movement should open up a new age of witnessing to the truth with music. People don't have to come to church to hear the truth—the"@en .
