<https://tplegacy.net/the-age-of-repentance/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLondon, England\n\nWhen Jesus came 2,000 years ago, the first thing he did was exhort the Israelites to \"Repent, for the Kingdom of Heaven is at hand.\"\n\nRepentance applies only to the sinner, the one who does wrong.\n\nAs individuals, Christians have done well in realizing sin and repenting with deep p"@en .
