<https://tplegacy.net/one-age-one-generation/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLondon, England\n\nWe find in the world that some people are born as men and others as women. A person may have an image of being someone else and wish he could have that life instead. For instance, some women wish they were born men, and some men wish they were born women.\n\nSome Africans wish they w"@en .
