<https://tplegacy.net/for-the-future/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nLondon, England\n\nToday is the point that connects yesterday with tomorrow. If today we are making progress from the past, then we look forward to tomorrow, but if we are regressing, then we have to worry about tomorrow.\n\nFor the sake of the future, all of us want today to be a time of progress rath"@en .
