<https://tplegacy.net/unification-church-heavenly-law/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nToday is March 1, and two months of this year are already gone. This is the first day of the remaining ten months.\n\nToday is a special day in that sixty years ago, Korea experienced a great independence movement while under Japanese suppression, and many people shed blood in a symbolic d"@en .
