<https://tplegacy.net/our-one-life/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nMan always thinks of centering on himself and so leads his life centering on himself.\n\nWhere does that tendency to value himself most of all come from?\n\nIt comes from God Himself. As a man finds himself elevated, he is happy, and he hates to find things the other way around.\n\nEach person"@en .
