<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-think/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nWhat are you thinking, sitting here early in the morning on a hard concrete floor? Are you happy to see me?\n\nHow can you be happy to see such a dark face with slanted eyes?\n\nWalking by a grove of trees, have you ever thought that they may have stood there for hundreds of years "@en .
