<https://tplegacy.net/the-importance-of-prayer/> <http://schema.org/description> "Reverend Moon gave this sermon at Belvedere, New York. In it, he describes his own attitude to prayer.\n\nThe most important thing in prayer is the attitude of the person who is praying.\n\nThe most essential thing is your commitment to go forward without reservation. If anything wants to block you, you"@en .
