<https://tplegacy.net/the-mission-of-our-life/> <http://schema.org/description> "Belvedere, New York\n\nWe are all born into life, and no one does not value his or her own life. Many times, we wonder why we were born and what our destination is. Throughout history, all men have thought about this fundamental question: \"For whom do I exist?\" These are serious questions.\n\n\nFor whom "@en .
