<https://tplegacy.net/mankind-and-the-ideal-world/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nWhat is the ideal world?\n\nIn the Unification Church, we teach that the ideal world equals the Kingdom of Heaven on earth. Therefore, I set this year's slogan as Home Church and the Completion of the Kingdom of Heaven.\n\nEven though mankind may not have a vital focus in their liv"@en .
