<https://tplegacy.net/reflection-upon-life/> <http://schema.org/description> "That\nBelvedere, New York\n\nThe meaning of my topic this morning is to turn around and evaluate life.\n\nToday is June 1. Now summer is practically here, and all of nature is ready. When you come to Belvedere, you might look at that one big tree outside here and remark on how big a tree it is.\n\nWhen you"@en .
