<https://tplegacy.net/record-setter-of-history/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, New York\n\nWhenever a champion enters a contest or major competition, his foremost desire is to set a record.\n\nFor example, in the Olympic Games, all the contestants go hoping to set a record. To do so, they have to follow all the rules and regulations set forth by the Olympic Committee.\n"@en .
