<https://tplegacy.net/thanksgiving-to-gods-will/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, Tarrytown, NY\n\nYou are some of the many young people living in the present time. When we look at young people on the college campuses or on the street, we wonder where they are headed. They live lives of intoxication, but without a goal.\n\nThey don't care much about the past or worry much"@en .
