<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-analyze-ourselves/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nMy topic this morning is our internal situation: Let Us Analyze Ourselves. If you assemble a large crowd, among them you will find young people and old, men and women, and people of five races.\n\nYou will find people of different circumstances: happy and sad, healthy and sick, excited and"@en .
