<https://tplegacy.net/historical-view-of-the-dispensation/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere, Tarrytown, NY\n\nI'm sure all of you realize the meaning of the day and the significance of September 18.\n\nToday, I want to deliver a message entitled \"Historical View of the Dispensation\" since you should know the historical background.\n\nThere are many religions today, but there are few t"@en .
