<https://tplegacy.net/men-of-god/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\n\"God\" in Korean is Hananim, and the literal translation is \"one master\" or \"only host.\" When you spell God backwards, what word do you get? Dog. One is heaven, and one is hell. On one side, men of God; on the other side, men of the dog.\n\nYou don't think of dogs as being very lowly and di"@en .
