<https://tplegacy.net/our-present-position/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nThe topic this morning refers to our present position in relation to God. People in general have a yearning to possess a high place and wide influence.\n\nWhen you go to such places as the Himalayan mountains or the vast Pacific Ocean, you enjoy their greatness. It is not easy to occupy a "@en .
