<https://tplegacy.net/house-of-providence/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nSince God's ideal of creation has not been fulfilled, the word restoration came into being. If there had been no fall, the house of the ideal would have been erected, but because of the fall, a house that needs to be restored came into being instead.\n\nIf there had been no fall, God inten"@en .
