<https://tplegacy.net/please-allow-us-to-establish-the-tradition-of-the-parents/> <http://schema.org/description> "Beloved Father, in the face of Your sacred Will, to block the flow of history and raise the shield of victory, we once again go down on our knees and beg You to forgive the shame of our ancestors.\n\nThe history of sin stemmed from Adam and Eve and has extended down to the innumerable human beings of "@en .
