<https://tplegacy.net/stony-path-of-death/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nWhat is this stony path?\n\nThat is the road of providence or dispensation. No one in history or in the world today readily volunteers to walk the stony path. No individual, family, society, or nation would like to walk a stony path, for they want to have a smooth road instead.\n\nPeople wou"@en .
