<https://tplegacy.net/persecution-and-blessing/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere International Training Center\n\nAs you are aware, today marks the 27th anniversary of the founding of our Church in 1954, which is also the anniversary of our Church's establishment. The history of the last 26 years has been marked by persecution.\n\n\nWhy have we been persecuted?\n\nIt had to "@en .
