<https://tplegacy.net/cross-over-the-boundary/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nNo one in our world likes a boundary. How about you?\n\nIf men dislike them, then would God like to have boundaries?\n\nLet us examine the history of boundaries; who made them to begin with? Most boundaries are established by men, of course. But there must be a spiritual cause preceding men "@en .
