<https://tplegacy.net/the-things-we-want-to-be-proud-of/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nEveryone has a name, and everyone wants to be proud of their name. Each person also wants to be proud of all the parts of his body-his limbs, his eyes, and all his faculties.\n\nSomeone who doesn't think he is attractive wants to find something that he thinks will make him more attractive."@en .
