<https://tplegacy.net/the-center-and-my-position/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\n\nWhat is the center of one's self?\n\nSomeone might say, \"My eye is my center.\" Someone like a carpenter, who is very active and uses his hands a lot, might say, \"My hands are the center.\"\n\nSomeone who is more intellectual might say, \"My brain is the center.\" Different people would have di"@en .
