<https://tplegacy.net/wanting-to-live-in-the-kingdom-of-heaven/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nIf someone asked you where the Kingdom of Heaven is, what would you say?\n\nThere is a simple way to describe the Kingdom of Heaven. It is a nice place, a happy place where a person can have everything they want. It is the place where the ideal dwells.\n\n\nWho needs the Kingdom of Heaven?\n\nF"@en .
