<https://tplegacy.net/the-deep-desire-of-our-original-nature/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nWhat is the desire of our original nature?\n\nWhen you say \"nature\" to most people, it conveys something they can see, something that is manifested. In other words, \"nature\" refers to the result rather than the cause. But when you say \"original nature,\" you are referring more to the cause "@en .
