<https://tplegacy.net/everyone-is-heading-somewhere/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nWhen we say, \"Everyone is heading somewhere,\" this is a universal statement.\n\nPeople in the past were heading somewhere; people in the present and also those in the future will all be heading somewhere.\n\nBut what is their destination?\n\nWhen children set out for school in the morning, the"@en .
