<https://tplegacy.net/in-the-presence-of-god/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nNobody was born by their own choice; none of us planned to be born. This is true not only for us but also for people of the past and future. A great mixture of people is born. Some boast of their superiority, others lament their inferiority.\n\nSome are good; others are bad. History will c"@en .
