<https://tplegacy.net/let-us-protect-ourselves/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nAll people want to be healthy, happy, and successful. It is easy to say such a thing, but when you think deeply, there are enormous implications behind it.\n\nFor instance, to be healthy, we must overcome all the influences that would make us unhealthy. To assure our happiness, we must com"@en .
