<https://tplegacy.net/victory-of-god/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nGood morning, everybody. My topic this morning is \"Victory of God.\" When I said \"victory,\" you applauded, even though I had not said anything yet. Victory sounds good; it tastes good to the tongue, but its contents are very difficult. Let us consider where we can apply the word 'victory."@en .
