<https://tplegacy.net/the-present-situation-centering-upon-the-will-of-god/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nBecause of the events during the past week, many of you have gone through extreme turmoil and sadness, but I want you to know that the things that have happened are all part of God's providence.\n\nI want you to understand, too, that the most important consideration is not what is happenin"@en .
