<https://tplegacy.net/the-road-of-gods-will/> <http://schema.org/description> "\nBelvedere\n\nMy topic this morning is the providential road, or the road of God's will.\n\nWhat is the difference between these two phrases?\n\nIn English, God's will is a subjective term and providence an objective term. Let's compare the Chinese characters for the two concepts. The character for will h"@en .
