<https://tplegacy.net/judgment-by-gods-word/> <http://schema.org/description> "It is a long way from Korea to America, yet God has been driving me here for a long time. Unless I had something new to reveal, I would not come here to speak to you at all.\n\nWhy should I come if I were to repeat the things that you already know?\n\nI would like for you and me to spend this time toget"@en .
